OL,3,GNEWSAThe historic sites being rescued
OL,4,Afrom ruin
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom mansions to monuments, the West of
OL,7,FEngland is dotted with heritage
OL,8,Flandmarks that have become woven into
OL,9,Flocal identity.
OL,11,FBut ageing stonework, decades of
OL,12,Fneglect and the rising cost of repairs
OL,13,Fhave landed some sites on Historic
OL,14,FEngland's Heritage at Risk list, facing
OL,15,Fan uncertain future.
OL,17,FDetermined charities and community
OL,18,Fcampaigners have rallied together,
OL,19,Fpieced together grants, donations and
OL,20,Fpublic funding to rescue them from
OL,21,Fruin.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
